t-on-social-media\/#faq-question-1779984281137\",\"position\":9,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-times-to-post-on-social-media\/#faq-question-1779984281137\",\"name\":\"9. Does the best time to post differ for B2B vs. B2C brands?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. B2B audiences are more active during weekday work hours, especially mornings and lunch breaks. B2C audiences engage more during evenings and weekends.\u00a0\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-times-to-post-on-social-media\/#faq-question-1779984295967\",\"position\":10,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-times-to-post-on-social-media\/#faq-question-1779984295967\",\"name\":\"10. What is the best time to post on social media\u00a0in Dubai and UAE?\u00a0\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The strongest windows are usually 10 AM to 3 PM GST and 7 PM to 10 PM GST. During Ramadan, engagement often shifts later into the evening after Iftar.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-times-to-post-on-social-media\/#faq-question-1779984311488\",\"position\":11,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-times-to-post-on-social-media\/#faq-question-1779984311488\",\"name\":\"11. What is the best time to post on social media\u00a0on Monday?\u00a0\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Monday engagement is strongest between 9 AM and 12 PM as audiences return to work and check social media throughout the morning.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-times-to-post-on-social-media\/#faq-question-1779984327571\",\"position\":12,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-times-to-post-on-social-medi